        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Your face is the controller!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you reach the goal first, or will your facial muscles give up first?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Jaw Jump!” is a 2D action game controlled by facial expression recognition using your webcam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your mouth to jump, and change the direction of your face to adjust the direction of your jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to keep climbing higher and higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept is simple, but precise control is required, making the game more difficult than it looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With privacy in mind, the game runs entirely offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera footage is used only for gameplay input and real-time display, and is never recorded, stored, or transmitted externally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with a webcam is recommended, but mouse controls are also supported.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Your face is the controller!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you reach the goal first, or will your facial muscles give up first?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Jaw Jump!” is a 2D action game controlled by facial expression recognition using your webcam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your mouth to jump, and change the direction of your face to adjust the direction of your jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to keep climbing higher and higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept is simple, but precise control is required, making the game more difficult than it looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With privacy in mind, the game runs entirely offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera footage is used only for gameplay input and real-time display, and is never recorded, stored, or transmitted externally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with a webcam is recommended, but mouse controls are also supported.</p>",
